the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    *a person* is a person; scenario element.
    *a person* was born on *a time*; scenario element.
    *a person* died on *a time*; scenario element.

the knowledge base life_act includes:

the text of the Life Act is at "sources/life_act.md".

the text of the Blawx project is at "sources/life_act.yaml".

